  "_meta": {
    "source": "Base Splendor 90-card table from bouk/splendimax 'Splendor Cards.csv' (github.com/bouk/splendimax), cross-verified card-for-card against seal256/splendor 'assets/cards.csv' (github.com/seal256/splendor). Gem-to-stone mapping: diamond/white->mind, sapphire/blue->space, emerald/green->soul, ruby/red->reality, onyx/black->power.",
